<title>UK: Rank holiday unit set to create 900 jobs.</title>
<headline>Rank holiday unit set to create 900 jobs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oasis Forest Holiday Villages, owned by the Rank Group Plc, said it will create almost 900 jobs in Cumbria, north west England, from developing a holiday village in the area.</p>
<p>The 100 million stg development ins the largest single investment Cumbria has ever recieved to its tourism industry, said the company in a statement. More than 700 full time jobs are being created with a further 180 part time ones.</p>
<p>The first Oasis Forest Holiday Village will open in May 1997.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
